        "text": "Step 2: Same Node, Different Character\nSame Person node, different attributes = completely different result.\nAbove: Supermodel + Nordic/Mexican = editorial street style in Paris.\nHere: Stunning Model + Italian/Swedish + Bare Shoulders = intimate indoor portrait.\nThe Person node writes prompt-engineer-level descriptions for you (\"editorial poise\", \"the line of the collarbone uncovered\") - just from dropdown picks.",
